    "verification": "Official libjpeg-turbo release tarball from the GitHub release 3.2.1 (published 2026-10-27), downloaded on 2026-11-24 (the newest stable release; UE 5.8 ships 3.0.0). Imported files are the libjpeg API library sources (the CMake JPEG_SOURCES list with the per-precision wrappers and the arithmetic coding sources), their headers, LICENSE.md and README.ijg. The TurboJPEG API, the tools, the image I/O sources, libspng, the MD5 code, the SIMD extensions, tests and documentation are not imported."
  },
